IWM1davCkbg&oe=6AAD3886"}, {"file_name": "Gorilla_CHasing.png", "id": "1343170760592134", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310667_1343170763925467_2625165734147829836_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L7xLvbEgPA4Q7kNvwGi8MLT&_nc_oc=AdolitLjljajbz1VlbyPXN1kq3hXafmy8zYQ-P84S5I5LuHhJMdgM_-DyCXWGEBUrEw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJZnC23CgV8lPEttbdJ8-xzP8UupzUl4XgjA2fNqh-NpA&oe=6AAD472D"}, {"file_name": "Gorilla_Chaserssssss.png", "id": "4034041696729937", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507840145_4034041700063270_105011202233764348_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rmZSCSUbNegQ7kNvwF1YFB0&_nc_oc=AdqYJ8Q5hM1wcIF0ON9D8Tv5tSbpZeHjyYER9qeUWnxJpak1IGEPmUrEo70THcfNe0I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLJyqDhx8N6TK8TL6Ld2TVMXIVRZLSL9dN1HvDqyiJxPQ&oe=6AAD5867"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ripple Taggers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "RIPPLE TAGGERS\n\nSwing, run, and scale your way to victory in Ripple Taggers, the ultimate fast-paced physics-based multiplayer tag game! Created by Direct, this game takes high-speed chase mechanics to the next level with incredibly smooth locomotion, customizable lobbies, and non-stop action.\n\n\ud83c\udf1f GAME FEATURES:\n\nCLASSIC LOCOMOTION: Master the iconic physics-based movement where your arms are your only tools to climb, jump, and escape other players.\n\nSHINY ROCKS & COSMETICS: Earn in-game currency as you play to unlock a massive catalog of epic cosmetics to customize your gorilla and show off your unique style.\n\nCUSTOM ROOMS & REGIONS: Instantly create and host private rooms using simple codes, broadcast your lobbies, and hang out with friends globally.\n\nFREQUENT UPDATES: Dive into fresh features, seasonal map rotations, and exciting new items designed to keep the chase thrilling.", "short_description": "RIPPLE TAGGE